WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
- He was my first boyfriend.

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.520
I almost don't want to give this one.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.530
- Skip it.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.107
- Next. Go.

00:00:06.107 --> 00:00:07.933
- He doesn't get BuzzFeed airtime!

00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:10.170
(squeaking hinge)

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.040
- OK. Hello. We are the
cast of "Wine Country,"

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.880
and we are going to play
BuzzFeed's BFF Game.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.760
We're gonna see what
kind of friends we are

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.230
and how much we know about each other.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.380
If you get it right, you get to drink.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.110
- Alright, I love that kind of rule.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.630
- Alright, you wanna
pick a card and go first?

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:23.463
- Yes, I will.

00:00:23.463 --> 00:00:24.296
- Alright.

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:26.474
- [Ana] Albarino?

00:00:26.474 --> 00:00:27.307
- You can't say it, can you?

00:00:27.307 --> 00:00:28.881
- Yeah, you just said it.

00:00:28.881 --> 00:00:30.070
(laughs)

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.445
- Alright, so on this one we're right.

00:00:31.445 --> 00:00:32.829
- Alright I said "Albarino."

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:33.662
- I said "Albarino."

00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:35.020
- Oh my god, you guys are amazing.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.789
- I said "fermented lentils."

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:39.039
(laughter)

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:42.857
- [Amy] I think I know what the answer is.

00:00:42.857 --> 00:00:44.530
"Last night." "Right now."

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.787
- Two minutes ago.

00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:48.297
- "Last night. Also today."
Those are all correct.

00:00:48.297 --> 00:00:50.547
(laughter)

00:00:51.947 --> 00:00:54.329
- "Two." "Two." "One and a half." "Three."

00:00:54.329 --> 00:00:55.250
- Ooooooh.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.880
- I love that you think
I can handle my liquor.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.013
Alas, I think one and a half.

00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:00.698
You know what, I'm gonna
give you one and a half

00:01:00.698 --> 00:01:01.787
to two guys.

00:01:01.787 --> 00:01:02.620
(glasses clinking)

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.014
- And I am not allowed to drink.

00:01:04.014 --> 00:01:05.810
- (beep)

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.623
- [Ana] I don't know. Virgo.

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.640
- But I'm close. A Sag?

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.290
- I know when your birthday is,
but I don't know when Sag is.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:14.380
- But I'm on a cusp.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.390
- You're not a Libra
'cause Pearl's a Libra.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:17.540
- I'm a Libra.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:18.373
- How?

00:01:18.373 --> 00:01:19.206
- 'Cause I'm on that cusp.

00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:20.039
- It starts at the end of-

00:01:20.039 --> 00:01:22.124
- This is where it starts. (fake crying)

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:24.180
- We can't drink!

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.260
- [Amy] I mean my real
friends know it, but-

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.980
- [Ana] Not your fake movie friends.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.200
- Light and sweet, like her men.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.460
- I said, "Milk, no sugar."

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.218
- I said, "You don't you drink tea."

00:01:31.218 --> 00:01:32.051
- Light and sweet.

00:01:32.051 --> 00:01:32.884
- Oh, damn!

00:01:34.784 --> 00:01:37.284
(all singing)

00:01:41.189 --> 00:01:43.439
(laughter)

00:01:44.517 --> 00:01:46.870
- Well I think we covered that.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.282
- [Ana] This is lentil payback.

00:01:48.282 --> 00:01:51.120
(laughter)

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.060
- Softball.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.072
- Payback time.

00:01:53.072 --> 00:01:53.905
- Field hockey. (laughs)

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:56.100
- The closest is Spivey with soccer,

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.570
but I was only on JV soccer.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:03.280
I played when I was a
sophomore. We were all on JV.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:06.360
And junior year all my friends
got moved up to varsity

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.640
except me!

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.890
But you know what? I
was in the school play,

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.502
and I played Anne Frank.

00:02:11.502 --> 00:02:12.335
(laughter)

00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:14.692
So (beep) all of you!

00:02:14.692 --> 00:02:15.529
(laughter)

00:02:15.529 --> 00:02:17.430
- That right there's
what you call a lentil.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.620
- Thank you for watching this,

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.697
and don't forget to check out

00:02:19.697 --> 00:02:22.517
"Wine Country" on Netflix, May 10.

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:25.530
- "Wine Country," not "Wine County."

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.890
My mom keeps asking about "Wine County."

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.097
It's "Wine Country."

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:31.556
